---
layout: shell.njk
title: 归档
permalink: /archive/
navKey: archive
---
<div class="page-shell">
  <header class="page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">// WRITING</p>
    <h1>文章归档 <span lang="en">All writing</span></h1>
    <p>按时间浏览所有公开笔记、技术拆解与源码文章。</p>
  </header>

  {% if blog.years.length %}
    {% for group in blog.years %}
      <div class="section-label">{{ group.year }} <span>· {{ group.posts.length }} 篇</span></div>
      <ol class="archive-list">
        {% for post in group.posts %}
        <li class="archive-row">
          <time datetime="{{ post.date }}">{{ post.date | cnDate | replace(group.year + ".", "") }}</time>
          <div class="archive-row__main">
            <a class="archive-row__title" href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.title }}</a>
            {% if post.description %}<p>{{ post.description }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="archive-row__meta">
            {% if post.topic %}<span>{{ post.topic.title }}</span>{% elif post.tags.length %}<span>{{ post.tags[0] }}</span>{% endif %}
            {% if post.readingMinutes %}<span>{{ post.readingMinutes }} min</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    {% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    <p class="empty">还没有文章。</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>
